algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: DifferenceSetSummary(S)
1. Compute D = {x-y : x,y in S}
2. D* = D \ {0}
3. D+ = {z in D* : z > 0}
4. diam = max(S) - min(S)
5. Assert |D*| = 2|D+| (Theorem A)
6. Assert D is translation-invariant (Theorem B)
7. Assert max|z| <= diam for z in D (Theorem C)
8. Return (D, D*, D+, diam, |D|, energy)
